[{"title":"哭大参刘朋节先生诗","author":"张诩","text":"薤露歌传远近悲，两间志士古今谁。\n杀身取义名千古，卖国偷生快一时。\n白刃如公真可蹈，丹心到死肯教移。\n英风飒飒淩朱鸟，俎豆毛杨许并祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53442,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭妹夫姚宪副","author":"张诩","text":"谁荐郎官入紫垣，共期霄汉快高骞。\n北行未究平生志，边戍真成万里冤。\n辽海赐环方度岭，玉楼求记未归魂。\n寻思旧雨西湖约，肠断来笺共学言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53443,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽镇北杨侯 其一","author":"张诩","text":"边徼尽还回纥马，甲光犹射受降城。\n黄沙大碛春应遍，瀚海阴山月自明。\n马革功名垂宇宙，麒麟图像任丹青。\n北天夜夜光摇动，知是明侯大将星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53444,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽镇北杨侯 其二","author":"张诩","text":"十月胡风浩浩吹，将营星殒北天低。\n玉鱼何处蒙恩葬，铁骑当年仰抹嘶。\n万里长城关外设，三边戎马手中提。\n云仍孙子多枝叶，主上临轩又折圭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53445,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答刘内翰见寄","author":"张诩","text":"万事足无梦，一身轻亦誇。\n醉狂扶杖起，细数上篱花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53446,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别刘公奇宪副二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"东溟春浪晓，迥映豸衣明。\n安得杯如瓠，同斟万顷清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53447,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别刘公奇宪副二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"渔翁渔海上，愧负百年心。\n乍别同心友，离情海未深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53448,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李士达进士","author":"张诩","text":"北来汉使者，秋枉粤山人。\n遥指飞霞上，青松挂月新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53449,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠郭生祐民大行刘德义甥","author":"张诩","text":"岭海炎蒸地，谁来访病龛。\n无缘起安石，空复见羊昙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53450,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榴花下与柱史三峰立谈感而偶成","author":"张诩","text":"石榴花下立清阴，人世劳劳慨古今。\n三尺龙唇千古调，岂期衰朽遇知音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53451,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湛内翰将行怅然有感兼怀阳明子","author":"张诩","text":"细雨寒江此送君，相思时复到河汾。\n凭君传语阳明子，我正扶衰候岭云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53452,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江","author":"张诩","text":"烟水西湖身日远，风云北阙梦长牵。\n木兰旧种千馀树，刳作秋江小渡船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53453,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小西湖竹林下偶成","author":"张诩","text":"行乐沿溪东复西，海风吹破薜罗衣。\n台城无限相思意，绿遍蘼芜燕未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53454,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶笔二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"秋入闲门静菊花，舞衣旋剪水边霞。\n醉来不记当时态，枕断铁桥秋月斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53455,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶笔二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"霏霏寒雨暗溪沙，瘦尽千峰菊始花。\n一月氤氲香不断，夜来都扑钓鱼槎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53456,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经彭烈女墓有感","author":"张诩","text":"玉颜一去无消息，玉骨空埋野土坡。\n谁为题名称烈女，至今馀韵感人多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53457,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒","author":"张诩","text":"玄碧花前倾紫霞，曲江回首夕阳斜。\n醉中童子问归去，遥指红云岛上家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53458,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀花下怀石翁先生","author":"张诩","text":"木犀香透越山云，记得根从海上分。\n恨杀西风夜来恶，一枝摧处正愁君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53459,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日偶成","author":"张诩","text":"五月松堂枕簟秋，一帘疏雨晚风收。\n客知烟际来时路，先向江边问白鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53460,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸳鸯","author":"张诩","text":"占得寒塘宿又飞，碧芦秋水共依依。\n白头不遂同心愿，误杀平生是锦机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53461,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"啜武夷春芽怀督府林公竹田","author":"张诩","text":"仙家春茗摘鎗旗，盏水烹来是上池。\n如此精华如此味，玉川到死不曾知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53462,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵九日写怀","author":"张诩","text":"仙轺一去何时回，又见篱边菊半开。\n未举重阳一杯酒，悲风断续自天来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53463,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陆丞相秀夫墓","author":"张诩","text":"海上坟传陆侍郎，一碑谁为表忠良。\n如今碑失坟何处，海水遗悲一样长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53464,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜园居二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"未老侵寻百病加，辟园还种邵平瓜。\n人间膏火心消尽，底用松花啖一车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53465,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜园居二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"池亭清绝树交加，静爱园居长菜瓜。\n饱食太平无一事，不妨闲驾白牛车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53466,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"张诩","text":"老去东篱感兴长，菊花还袭道袍香。\n独吟佳色秋风里，始信芙蓉不耐霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53467,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夕独酌二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"近来天地少闲人，偶此倾杯对月真。\n啼鸟未知秋过半，落花犹错认残春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53468,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夕独酌二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"风来松涧长丝竹，月丽山花尽绮罗。\n秋酿一瓢歌又舞，争教老子不婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53469,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读东厓集偶成二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"西湖寂寞如年夜，到处扶携避寇时。\n细雨张灯孤榻冷，宽愁赖有锦囊诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53470,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读东厓集偶成二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"蛾眉毓秀锦江清，多少英雄此地生。\n遗爱如公为郡县，后人胡只以诗称。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53471,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日同杨别驾西郭访崔自仙宅","author":"张诩","text":"四野秋风两袖飘，沿溪问处未辞遥。\n年光已换十馀度，依旧柴门锁石桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53472,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"六月度岭","author":"张诩","text":"六旬七次度梅关，回首梅关想岁阑。\n衰病似难堪跋涉，寸心觉比旧时丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53473,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将度岭戏题","author":"张诩","text":"才出关来又入关，此心元与岭云闲。\n山灵莫讶囊无有，宇宙清风满载还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53474,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢人惠菊","author":"张诩","text":"霜欺雪压意安闲，中有贞心不怕寒。\n万紫千红零落后，一株谁遣到骚坛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53475,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别宪长方松厓","author":"张诩","text":"宪使秋过粤水滨，昔年遗爱在吾人。\n入城丹荔还遮道，都是甘棠一树春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53476,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠宪副刘毓之进表入京","author":"张诩","text":"三岁罗浮几次过，分蓑曾共卧烟萝。\n月明风细归槎静，隔岸时闻欸乃歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53477,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"罗浮别董东湖","author":"张诩","text":"凭高一望出氛埃，多少江山眼底开。\n宇宙无穷双目短，不知何处是天台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53478,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别周侍御二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"金山铁水晓霜寒，暂著鹑衣伴豸冠。\n欲向江山消别恨，江山翻觉别君难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53479,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别周侍御二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"小金山下暂维舟，同向诸天汗漫游。\n回首唐虞千百载，春云一点太空浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53480,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠世杰进士谢病归潮阳","author":"张诩","text":"谢病初从海上归，西湖还款我柴扉。\n秋风恨不携君去，千仞冈头一振衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53481,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠区生","author":"张诩","text":"秋水秋云杳一乡，月明谁此棹相将。\n只愁错认来时路，处处春风茉莉香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53482,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答柳汝澜","author":"张诩","text":"亲遇金华老牧羊，囊收六合一毫芒。\n何时再入西湖路，对榻张灯话武昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53483,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答陈悦之见示二首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"旧约秋眠月一窝，荷衣风弄影婆娑。\n有金不买西湖醉，风月其如良夜何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53484,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答陈悦之见示二首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"谩说秋光处处同，眼前烟水得随公。\n醉来共把君山笛，吹入洞庭秋月中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53485,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳日答杨舜臣见示怀仙十咏","author":"张诩","text":"沈酣蒲酒世纷纷，十咏怀仙闻不闻。\n即欲与君携笛去，月明吹尽铁桥云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53486,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答江桂轩宪副见示四首 其一","author":"张诩","text":"洞门秋冷日如年，我与烟花了宿缘。\n尽日乌啼秋雨里，榴花笑伴石床眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53487,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答江桂轩宪副见示四首 其二","author":"张诩","text":"秋光荡漾此无涯，花既婆娑鸟亦嗟。\n茅屋松林映秋水，石门何谢鹿门家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53488,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答江桂轩宪副见示四首 其三","author":"张诩","text":"病枕焉知世上年，烟花钓艇是随缘。\n西风捲尽南窗雨，明月千峰中酒眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53489,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答江桂轩宪副见示四首 其四","author":"张诩","text":"烟波咫尺便天涯，阆苑人间莫浪嗟。\n芳草出门伤客路，东风游子未辞家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53490,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古迹任嚣城","author":"张诩","text":"我闻南海尉，亲拜秦皇命。\n如何垂死日，独速龙川令。\n萧曹岂伊人，骤授侯王柄。\n累累百雉城，遗迹了无證。\n惟馀偏伯风，飒飒生五岭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53491,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵佗城","author":"张诩","text":"衮衣玉食居然僭，自比萧曹亦不疑。\n十里金城何处所，只今惟有月明知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53492,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安期升仙台","author":"张诩","text":"白日登宸去，三珠几度花。\n秦皇无觅处，第见枣如瓜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53493,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朝汉台","author":"张诩","text":"众星拱北知天道，万水朝宗识地灵。\n朝汉有台当混一，岂缘高帝事穷兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53494,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘王郊台","author":"张诩","text":"五代乱离际，虎据南越陬。\n称制乘黄屋，下令崇圜丘。\n僭复扫地规，有事于春秋。\n燔柴登黄坛，秉圭被玄裘。\n淫哇无九成，骏奔非诸侯。\n明堙祈奏格，海风空飕飕。\n鼎鱼思假息，穴蚁求久休。\n遗壝今霍然，但见樵苏游。\n慨彼周东迁，礼乐成谬悠。\n鲁郊不欲观，自馀何足尤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53495,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甘溪","author":"张诩","text":"海滨多斥卤，此水独称真。\n泉脉应通海，清甘故可人。\n几回陵谷变，转瞬古今陈。\n当时歌舞地，极目但寒蓁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53496,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宋公遗爱祠","author":"张诩","text":"懿哉宋公，德大有容。\n明明在公，耿耿于衷。\n民始茅茨，火灾是苦。\n寔公教之，陶瓦筑堵。\n公之去矣，笑色日远。\n遗爱在人，千载弗谖。\n生则君之，死则尸之。\n君之尸之，民之秉彝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53497,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘王花坞","author":"张诩","text":"刘王僭号乾亨初，金羊游幸驾云车。\n近者月峡远禹馀，更有花坞藏名姝。\n桃花落水如锦铺，紫衣霞裾引女巫。\n琼仙花貌西施都，廷琄忠胆伍子胥。\n剑树刀山纣不如，听谗杀忠类阖闾。\n清歌妙舞恰欢娱，一夜芝囷生墙隅。\n野兽触宫羊吐珠，井石立行百步馀。\n百花回首化蓁芜，已见麋鹿游姑苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53498,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离宫","author":"张诩","text":"徐福楼船不见还，茂陵松柏亦摧残。\n区区恩赦何为者，也向离宫学炼丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53499,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉液池","author":"张诩","text":"五月五日彩队出，宫娥粉黛争盛饰。\n龙舟竞渡玉液池，君王沈醉连日夕。\n淡荡春风花草香，黄鹂恰恰啼萧墙。\n当时歌舞游人乐，今日荒苔管夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53500,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花田","author":"张诩","text":"玉貌赛杨妃，专宫宠特奇。\n生憎脂粉涴，不分月明欺。\n金屋人何在，素馨名独垂。\n娇羞如可貌，得似在宫时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53501,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远华楼","author":"张诩","text":"远华楼前百花开，金鞭紫骝嘶将来。\n明眸皓齿绝世艳，玉箫金管振天哀。\n远华楼前百花落，夜夜楼头吹画角。\n笙歌声断昼沈沈，烟草愁生春漠漠。\n花开花落自年年，今日繁华非复前。\n尘世几人能得仙，古来无恙此山川。\n草芥功名何足觅，浮云富贵终何益。\n君不见漳河铜雀起秋风，洛下铜驼在荆棘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53502,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寿安院","author":"张诩","text":"期治安，开寿域。\n东溟波，震孙泽。\n衣我衣，食我食。\n彼无恶，此无斁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53503,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洗耳亭","author":"张诩","text":"楚汉纷争兮，四海割据。\n上无尧德兮，畴识巢父。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53504,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笔授轩 其一","author":"张诩","text":"白马驮经来洛阳，楞严笔授此何乡。\n从此法流东土遍，曹溪一水入云长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53505,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"笔授轩 其二","author":"张诩","text":"孔颜之后又朱程，万古斯文此日星。\n麟笔几人传不错，较成蝌蚪未亡经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53506,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋归亭","author":"张诩","text":"陆贾通南越，黄金满橐回。\n而今腰纵折，谁肯赋归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53507,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊坡亭","author":"张诩","text":"菊湖之上菊坡亭，西望罗浮万仞青。\n到处事功唐李泌，暮年风节汉严陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53508,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"慈元殿","author":"张诩","text":"厓山尚说慈元殿，死事多传杨太妃。\n势力尽消名分在，江山犹是主人非。\n伤心北骑腥尘满，回首西山日色微。\n一自沧波沈玉后，贞风人叹古来稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53509,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东坡亭","author":"张诩","text":"闻道坡亭迹已空，古劳都下几秋风。\n神仙到处期钟鼎，出处当年恨长公。\n一代文章如白日，百年心事逐飘蓬。\n数声愿借辽阳鹤，唤醒英魂冥漠中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山书堂","author":"张诩","text":"僧寺依山麓，书堂面水隈。\n鼎湖龙驭远，禺竹凤声哀。\n禹贡不及载，秦关尚未开。\n如何二帝子，万里却能来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万人城","author":"张诩","text":"长城筑中宿，雉堞一万个。\n飞语岭外传，关中今已破。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕喜亭","author":"张诩","text":"连山苍苍，湟水东之。\n之公之谪，委蛇委蛇。\n陟彼高原，乃夷乃披。\n有亭岿然，韩愈作碑。\n天子在御，公遄来归。\n智谋仁居，天朝羽仪。\n世远人亡，名流燕喜。\n文光万丈，照耀天地。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双溪亭","author":"张诩","text":"青山想像昔诗人，明月不见裴侍御。\n一条白练自天飞，双溪亭前和人语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"濯缨堂","author":"张诩","text":"吾闻古君子，无入不自得。\n身穷道不穷，兹理甚不惑。\n双溪本沧浪，魏公亦孺子。\n有歌人不闻，时无圣人耳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丞相书院 其一","author":"张诩","text":"每闻车马当局错，几见盐梅下手亲。\n张罗欲捕当年凤，笑杀东湖卖屦人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":53516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]